'''Nerd Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] increases attack power and [[Slow|slows]] non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Nerd Cat is unlocked in the Rare Cat Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

