==Trivia==
*Before [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] [[Version 3.0 Update|Ver. 3.0]], Nerd Cat's description was: "Said to be unstoppable... if in his room. Net denizen who is famous for flaming. Uber long distance attacker."
*Nerd Cat was given the "Long Distance" ability in BCEN [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], along with a doubling of its attack power to compensate.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Hacker Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Cybercrimes (Removed Combo)|Cybercrimes]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Nerd Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Nerd Cat
Completely fearless… until leaving his basement.
Net denizen who is famous for flaming.
Uber Long Distance attack specialist.</pre>
<pre>Hacker Cat
Famous for making Big Red Buttons.
Graduate from an elite tech university.
Uber Long Distance attack specialist.</pre>
<pre>Cyberpunk Cat
Having mastered virtual space, he's moved on
to losing his shirt in the cryptocurrency market.
Long-range area attacks slow non-Metal.</pre>
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Nerd Cat's true form goes unused but is present in the game's code. If it were to be deployed, it will run through all of its animations before remaining in its first frame in its idle animation.

